[
  {
    "op": "add",
    "path": "/objects/SessionSpaceInfo",
    "value": {
      "document": "描述会话空间的完整信息。会话空间是用户状态、会话和事件的上级资源及隔离边界，同一个会话只能属于一个会话空间。",
      "members": [
        {
          "disabled": false,
          "document": "<p>会话空间唯一标识，由服务端生成，最大长度为 128 个字符。调用方不应自行构造或解析。</p>",
          "member": "string",
          "name": "SpaceId",
          "required": false,
          "type": "string",
          "example": "space-example",
          "output_required": true,
          "value_allowed_null": false
        },
        {
          "disabled": false,
          "document": "<p>会话空间名称，用于标识会话空间的业务用途，最大长度为 128 个字符。</p>",
          "member": "string",
          "name": "Name",
          "required": false,
          "type": "string",
          "example": "my test space 003",
          "output_required": true,
          "value_allowed_null": false
        },
        {
          "disabled": false,
          "document": "<p>会话空间描述，用于说明业务用途和使用范围，最大长度为 512 个字符。为空时该字段可能不返回</p>",
          "member": "string",
          "name": "Description",
          "required": false,
          "type": "string",
          "example": "for test only",
          "output_required": false,
          "value_allowed_null": false
        },
        {
          "disabled": false,
          "document": "<p>会话空间当前状态。</p><p>枚举值：</p><ul><li>Active： 正常可用</li><li>Deleting： 正在删除</li></ul>",
          "member": "string",
          "name": "Status",
          "required": false,
          "type": "string",
          "example": "Active",
          "output_required": true,
          "value_allowed_null": false
        },
        {
          "disabled": false,
          "document": "<p>是否为系统默认会话空间。true 表示默认会话空间，false 表示普通会话空间。默认会话空间不允许删除。</p>",
          "member": "bool",
          "name": "Default",
          "required": false,
          "type": "bool",
          "example": "true",
          "output_required": true,
          "value_allowed_null": false
        },
        {
          "disabled": false,
          "document": "<p>会话空间创建时间，采用 ISO 8601/RFC 3339 格式。</p>",
          "member": "string",
          "name": "CreateTime",
          "required": false,
          "type": "string",
          "example": "2026-08-17T11:10:13.368Z",
          "output_required": true,
          "value_allowed_null": false
        },
        {
          "disabled": false,
          "document": "<p>会话空间最后更新时间，采用 ISO 8601/RFC 3339 格式。</p>",
          "member": "string",
          "name": "UpdateTime",
          "required": false,
          "type": "string",
          "example": "2026-08-17T11:15:33.392Z",
          "output_required": true,
          "value_allowed_null": false
        }
      ],
      "type": "object",
      "usage": "output"
    }
  },
